    // 5. Urgency: If this is the only bin that fits the current item (fitting_bins_count == 1),
    // and the post_residual is poor, we might be forced into a bad state. 
    // We penalize this bin slightly less to prevent opening a new bin prematurely.
    if fitting_bins_count == 1 && post_residual > 20 {
